notes = "The actual visible Draconic Presence spatial UUID owns the existing wisps at its real disclosed anchor. The exact current public anchor_entity_uuid supplies the measured actor geometry; absent identity or optical geometry refuses without borrowing a caster or nearby body. The original presence shader continues its own clock without finite retirement, until actual owner disappearance. This is an authored local owner halo, not a reconstruction of its sixty-foot gameplay radius or a choice of awe/fear from recipient outcomes. Actual Charmed/Frightened members retain their independent treatments. The initial action delegates this same visual to the real spatial owner, avoiding duplicate four-second art. All artwork remains unreviewed; rendered-output qualification remains separate."
